WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:12.420
Phone app: connect your phone and your team's phones to this panel to see chats, alerts and approvals on the go. The phone app is installed from the phone's browser onto the home screen.

2
00:00:12.968 --> 00:00:22.370
First set up a fixed public address; with the temporary one the phone cannot connect. Then click "Connect a phone" to show the QR code.

3
00:00:22.915 --> 00:00:49.890
Scan the first QR code with the phone's camera to open the app's address. On Android (Chrome), tap "Install on the home screen"; on iPhone (Safari), tap Share, then “Add to Home Screen”, and open the app from the Home Screen. Then click "Show the connection code" on the computer, tap "Connect to your computer" in the phone app, and scan or type the code. It works once, for 10 minutes.

4
00:00:50.443 --> 00:01:05.350
In the phone app, tap "Turn on alerts" and allow them; on an iPhone, alerts work only from the home-screen app. Phones appear under "Connected phones"; disconnect a lost phone, or the phone of someone who has left, right here.

5
00:01:05.902 --> 00:01:11.690
Don't send the connection code to anyone; whoever scans it gets access to your chats.
